BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After School Solar Observing Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T170000
UID:6aa049d1442d35226f6765dd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the patio at Fort York to celebrate Science Literac
 y with a solar observing party!\nUniversity of Toronto Dunlap Institute a
 stronomers will set up telescopes equipped with solar filters to look at t
 he sun and see sunspots and solar prominences. Participants will also lear
 n about solar viewing safety.\nThis program is for participants 6-12 year
 s and their families (parents and siblings welcome)!\nDrop in\, no registr
 ation required. Participants will have the opportunity to mill around and 
 talk to astronomers\, look through telescopes\, and create chalk art on th
 e patio.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Back Patio
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa049d1442d35226f6765dd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
