 y Indigenous artists Nichole Leveck & Isaiah Cada\n2:30pm\nScreen Printing
  Demo\nby East End Collective\n2:30-4pm\nBlackout poetry workshop\n\, led 
 by Jennifer Long\n2:30-4pm\nCyanotype bookmark workshop\n\, led by Ursula 
 Handleigh\n2-4pm\nCommunity Exhibition\nfeaturing work led by Aniqa Qadir\
 , Jennifer Long\, and Shannyn Porter\nDrop in welcome if space is availabl
 e
