DESCRIPTION:Design your own spooky Halloween digital postcard!  Scratch Jr
 . is a coding App that uses blockly coding for very young kids.  No coding
  experience necessary.\nThis program takes place during Digital Inclusion 
 Week 2026.\nFor children ages 6 to 12 years.  Drop-in\, no registration r
 equired.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this
