BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Story Planet Comic Lab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T173000
UID:69fb9cf9caf93436005a3607@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Artists in the Library series comes to Evelyn Gregory Libr
 ary this Fall!  Led by professional illustrators Hilary Leung and Joseph
  Bonsu\, children will explore the art of comics and build a portfolio of 
 work culminating in a polished long-form comic. The program concludes with
  a Comic Con showcase\, where their work is shared with the community.\nFo
 r ages 9-12.\nSpaces are limited.  Registration required.
LOCATION:Evelyn Gregory
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fb9cf9caf93436005a3607
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
