UID:6aac38932f069c092b98b43b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special program in honor of Orange Shirt Day. Le
 arn about what Orange Shirt Day is\, why we observe it\, and listen to a r
 eading of\nThe Orange Shirt\nStory by Phyllis Webstad. After the story\, k
 ids can get creative by making heart crafts and decorating their own paper
  orange shirt to celebrate kindness\, empathy and respect\, and honor the 
 truth that Every Child Matters.\nThis is a staff-led program using resourc
 es developed by The Orange Shirt Society.\nIf you or your child lives with
  a disability and requires an accessibility accommodation to participate i
 n this program\, please contact Accessibility Service by email\naccessible
 services@tpl.ca\nor voicemail\, 416-393-7099
